  "finiteMax_profile_parameter_review": {
    "conclusion": "NO_FINDINGS",
    "profile4_row_le": "The explicit fun row=>eligible row t and fun row=>profile row t are literally the two functions in the unchanged profile4 definition at the same point t. rows, seed, r, hr and he are unchanged.",
    "overlapping_candidates": "Both calls pass the same original full function fun row=>candidateExponent loss (mask row), retaining the original masks, loss and both eligibility/membership proofs. max_le still compares the same two candidates against the maximum of all eligible rows.",
